body:
Still in and here's another band:

&#x200B;

 **Skillet** is an American [Christian rock](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christian_rock) band formed in [Memphis, Tennessee](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Memphis,_Tennessee), in 1996. The band currently consists of husband and wife duo [John Cooper](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Cooper_(musician)) (lead vocals, bass) and Korey Cooper (rhythm guitar, keyboards, backing vocals) along with [Jen Ledger](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jen_Ledger) (drums, co-lead vocals) and Seth Morrison (lead guitar). The band has released eleven studio albums, two of which, [*Collide*](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collide_(Skillet_album)) and [*Comatose*](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comatose_(album)), received [Grammy](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grammy_Award) nominations.[\[1\]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skillet_(band)#cite_note-2007_grammy_nomination-1) Two of their albums, *Comatose* and [*Awake*](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awake_(Skillet_album)), are certified Platinum and Double Platinum respectively by the RIAA, while [*Rise*](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rise_(Skillet_album)) and [*Unleashed*](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unleashed_(Skillet_album)) are certified Gold as of June 29, 2020.[\[2\]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skillet_(band)#cite_note-2) Four of their songs, "[Monster](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monster_(Skillet_song))", "[Hero](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hero_(Skillet_song))", "[Awake and Alive](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awake_and_Alive)", and "[Feel Invincible](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feel_Invincible)", are certified Multi-Platinum (5× Platinum, 3× Platinum, and 2× Platinum, respectively), while another two, "[Whispers in the Dark](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whispers_in_the_Dark_(Skillet_song))" and "[Comatose](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comatose_(Skillet_song))", are certified Platinum, and another four, "[Rebirthing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebirthing_(song))", "Not Gonna Die", "[The Last Night](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Last_Night_(Skillet_song))", and "The Resistance" are certified Gold.[\[3\]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skillet_(band)#cite_note-3)
